{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Sprinkle upon them water of chatat.</b> Of the ashes of the cow — because of those among them who were impure through contact with the dead." "<b>And they shall pass a razor.</b> I found in the words of Rabbi Moshe the Darshan: since atonement was given for the firstborn, who had served idolatry — and it is called זִבְחֵי מֵתִים, and the metzora is called מֵת — He required of them shaving like metzora'im."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:56.254547026Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}